        {
            "key": "ct_faqs",
            "scope": "contact-us",
            "items": [
                [
                    "What services does Intelliworkz provide?",
                    "We provide brand, creative, digital, technology, publishing, post-production, animation, engineering and dedicated team services. The right combination depends on your business requirement, project scope and objectives."
                ],
                [
                    "Can you handle both one-time projects and ongoing work?",
                    "Yes. We work on one-time and milestone-based projects as well as ongoing work, through engagement models such as FTE / retainership, GCC, transaction and one-time."
                ],
                [
                    "Can I discuss my requirement before deciding to work with you?",
                    "Yes. Tell us what you are trying to build, improve, market or manage, and we will understand your requirement, identify the right capabilities and connect you with the right team. Where it helps, we can run a proof of concept on a paid or free trial."
                ],
                [
                    "Will I have a dedicated team for my project?",
                    "Yes. The same or similarly skilled resources work on your orders every time, with a dedicated project manager as your point of contact."
                ],
                [
                    "Do you outsource the work to freelancers?",
                    "No. Our 100% in-house team does not further outsource or engage freelance teams to execute orders, which ensures client confidentiality."
                ],
                [
                    "Can you work with our existing brand guidelines and materials?",
                    "Yes. We work from your brand guidelines and existing content, and address anything missing before design begins."
                ]
            ]
        },
